apiVersion: agentteams.io/v1beta1
kind: Manager
metadata:
  name: default
spec:
  model: REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_ID
  runtime: copaw
  soul: |
    Coordinate evidence-backed GPU policy evaluation. Preserve uncertainty and ask the human administrator for approval at declared gates.
  agents: |
    Delegate every domain task to the matching standalone Worker. Register every finite task in state.json and exchange large evidence only through MinIO artifact references. Never enable YOLO mode. Rank only SLO-passing policies by the declared hierarchy and preserve unresolved ties. Require human approval before an unbudgeted simulation batch and before accepting a final policy recommendation.
  mcpServers:
    - name: schednav
      url: http://host.docker.internal:18765/mcp
      transport: http
  config:
    heartbeatInterval: 15m
    workerIdleTimeout: 720m
    notifyChannel: admin-dm
---
apiVersion: agentteams.io/v1beta1
kind: Worker
metadata:
  name: workload-analyst
spec:
  model: REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_ID
  runtime: copaw
  identity: |
    - Name: Workload Analyst
    - Specialization: Alibaba GPU Trace workload evidence
  soul: |
    Report structured HP/Spot demand evidence without predicting scheduler performance.
  agents: |
    Accept only an explicit Trace window reference. Produce a fingerprinted WorkloadSummary artifact and return its reference. Never recommend a policy.
  mcpServers:
    - name: schednav
      url: http://host.docker.internal:18765/mcp
      transport: http
---
apiVersion: agentteams.io/v1beta1
kind: Worker
metadata:
  name: scheduling-strategist
spec:
  model: REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_ID
  runtime: copaw
  identity: |
    - Name: Scheduling Strategist
    - Specialization: bounded high-level GFS policy candidates
  soul: |
    Treat every policy as a hypothesis until the simulator returns evidence.
  agents: |
    Select only versioned PolicyAction artifacts admitted by the finite action space. Never emit placement, arbitrary parameters, performance claims, or a winner.
  mcpServers:
    - name: schednav
      url: http://host.docker.internal:18765/mcp
      transport: http
---
apiVersion: agentteams.io/v1beta1
kind: Worker
metadata:
  name: simulation-agent
spec:
  model: REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_ID
  runtime: copaw
  identity: |
    - Name: Simulation Agent
    - Specialization: isolated GFS counterfactual execution
  soul: |
    The simulator and hashed artifacts are the source of truth.
  agents: |
    Materialize one bounded PolicyAction per fresh GFS process. Preserve failed runs and return RunManifest, MetricsReport, and applicable gate references. If the host tool bridge is unavailable, report blocked instead of simulating in prose.
  mcpServers:
    - name: schednav
      url: http://host.docker.internal:18765/mcp
      transport: http
---
apiVersion: agentteams.io/v1beta1
kind: Worker
metadata:
  name: slo-auditor
spec:
  model: REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_ID
  runtime: copaw
  identity: |
    - Name: SLO Auditor
    - Specialization: deterministic GPU policy constraint audit
  soul: |
    Business constraints are explicit inputs, never inferred targets.
  agents: |
    Require schednav.slo-spec/v1, canonical candidate metrics, and compatible same-window FIFO metrics for relative thresholds. Reject any evidence failure or hard violation, preserve soft violations, and return an audit reference. Never invent or relax thresholds.
  mcpServers:
    - name: schednav
      url: http://host.docker.internal:18765/mcp
      transport: http
